@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 60

database "final_dataset.csv" as Final
rectangle "Chronological\nSplit" as Split
rectangle "Model Training" as Training
rectangle "Metric\nEvaluation" as Metrics
database "model_results.csv" as Results
database "confusion_matrices.json" as Confusion
rectangle "Plot\nGeneration" as Plotting
database "reports/figures" as Figures
rectangle "Tkinter UI" as UI

Final --> Split : 70% train\n15% validation\n15% test
Split --> Training : same test\nperiod
Training --> Metrics : predictions
Metrics --> Results : accuracy\nroc_auc\nf1\nprecision\nrecall
Metrics --> Confusion : 2x2 matrices
Results --> Plotting
Confusion --> Plotting
Plotting --> Figures : PNG reports
Figures --> UI : selected plot\nshown on right panel
@enduml
